abstract: >-
  LIMP is a laboratory antimicrobial-peptide design method family comprising
  a discriminative inverse-design implementation (LIMP-DI) and a scalable
  autoregressive generator (LIMP-AR).
keywords:
  - antimicrobial peptide
  - causal Transformer
  - peptide generation
